  "visual_observation": "Black continuous curve on a complete half-unit grid; horizontal x axis and vertical y axis with arrows. x labels -6,-5,-4,-3,-2,-1, then 2,3,4,5,6,7,8; origin label 0; y labels 2 and 3. The unlabelled x=1 position is present in the grid. The curve starts below the x axis at x=-6, rises through about -4 to a peak near (-2,2), falls across the axis between 0 and 1 to a trough near (2,-1), then rises through about 3 and continues to (8,3). The right endpoint is fully visible and is not extended past x=8.",
